over two million immigrants live from both worlds. As a result, there are the haves and the have-nots. Here is the world's newest \"city of dreams.\" But in the shadow of the chaos, crime is rampant: drugs, prostitution, and weapon trafficking. The detectives who stand up to these heinous crimes are in the San Teresa City Police. When the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana — two individuals who differ in gender, personality, and even world of origin — meet, an incident erupts. Two worlds. Two justices. From this, the curtain rises on a buddy police action story!\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["コップクラフト",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-25003":"2020-04-22T11:09:25Z","serial-20597":"2020-01-02T21:22:44Z","serial-18159":"2019-12-23T19:44:33Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-25003","serial-20597","serial-18159"],"relatedMalIds":[],"availableEpisodeCount":12,"rating":6.72}]}